  "footnotes": [],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 71 as printed (including the bare repeated heading row '高雄州' at the top of p. 12, which has no 所在地 or figures: all cells empty).",
   "Decimal separator: the printed mark is a low dot/comma that is hard to tell apart in this low-resolution scan; written as '.' throughout (e.g. 28.65 km). 「…」 = nil as printed.",
   "Row labels: 官署 is letter-spaced in print; 州・廳 names are the bold heading rows; '〃' (ditto, for 役所/支廳) is kept as printed, e.g. '基隆 〃'. 所在地 is printed letter-spaced across five/six slots; written joined, e.g. '基隆市日新町'; '〃' kept where the place is printed as ditto, with any following characters appended ('〃東門町', '〃大宮町', '〃湊町').",
   "Many 所在地 lines overlap their neighbours in print (rows set too close together, ghosting); the characters were separated by their column slots. Least certain readings: 彰化 〃 (first one, 彰化市彰化) and 大屯郡役所 (臺中市利國町); 北斗 〃 '北斗街西北斗' (three characters 西, 北, 斗 spread over the last three slots); 中壢 〃 '中壢街石頭'; 新豐郡役所 '臺南市東門町'; 高雄州 '高雄市前金' (町 may follow); 嘉義 〃 (second) '嘉義市堀川町'.",
   "Unreadable cells ('[?]', digit lost against the column rule or smudged): row 竹東 〃 col 州廳迄 陸路 (15.?0, 4 or 6); row 苗栗 〃 col 總督府迄 陸路 (2.?9); row 新營 〃 col 總督府迄 陸路 (3.0?); row 屏東 〃 (first, 屏東市本町) col 州廳迄 陸路 (2.6?). Also the last digit of some cells in the 州廳迄 陸路 column touches the rule (2.01 苗栗, 2.73 高雄市役所, 1.26 彰化 〃, 2.79 嘉義 〃) and was read as shown.",
   "Arithmetic remark (not used to read any cell): 關山 〃 總督府迄 鐵道 161.40 vs 臺東廳 203.30 less 州廳迄 鐵道 41.97 would be 161.33; 新化 〃 319.29 vs 臺南州 330.79 less 11.43 would be 319.36. Printed as read.",
   "No totals in this table."
  ],
